// context: Error. There is an opeeration waiting for completion
"Queda pendiende otra operación."
END

LAN:ErrorUnknown
// context: Error message.
"Error desconocido"
END

LAN:JoinFailed
// context: Error when trying to join a game. The game might be canceled.
