Map:MAPMPMarshesofMidgewater/Desc
//"An area within Bree-land in the south-eastern region. It is known for its treacherous bogs that extend as far as the Weather Hills. \n\n Size: 500 x 500 \n Lairs: 2x Spider Lair, 2x Troll Lair \n Neutral Structures: 1x Inn"
"Una zona dentro de Bree-land en la región sureste. Es conocida por sus traicioneras ciénagas que se extienden hasta las Colinas del Tiempo. \n\n Tamaño: 500 x 500 \n Guaridas: 2x guarida de arañas, 2x guarida de troles \n Estructuras neutrales: 1x posada"
END

