//not7.0.0
MAP:MAPMPEastfoldII/Desc
//"The eastern lands of Rohan, bordering Gondor.\n\n Size: 455 x 390\n Lairs: 6x Goblin Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 1x Outpost"
"Las tierras orientales de Rohan, que bordean Gondor.\n\n Tamaño: 455 x 390\n Guaridas: 6x guarida de trasgos, 2x guarida de troles\n Estructuras neutrales: 1x enclave"
