//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPArchet
"Archet"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPArchet/Desc
//"Archet was a remote village of Bree-land, set among the trees on the edge of the Chetwood, east of Bree itself. \n\n Size: 380 x 350 \n Lairs: 1x Troll Lair, 2x Spider Lair, 2x Warg Lair, 2x Goblin Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Signal Fire"
"Archet era un pueblo remoto de Bree-land, ubicado entre los árboles al borde del Bosque Chet, al este de Bree. \n\n Tamaño: 380 x 350 \n Guaridas: 1x Guarida de Trol, 2x Guarida de Araña, 2x Guarida de Huargo, 2x Guarida de Trasgo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x almenaras"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPBuckleburyFerry
//"Bucklebury Ferry"
"Ferry de Bucklebury"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPBuckleburyFerry/Desc
//"Bucklebury Ferry was a raft-ferry used as the second main crossing point of the Brandivino River from the Shire to Buckland. \n\n Size: 335 x 370 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 4x Warg Lair, 2x Goblin Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
"El Ferry de Bucklebury era una balsa utilizada como el segundo cruce principal del río Brandivino desde la Comarca hasta Buckland. \n\n Tamaño: 335 x 370 \n Guaridas: 2x Guarida de Trol, 4x Guarida de Huargo, 2x Guarida de Trasgo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x Posada"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPNearKhand
//"Near Khand"
"Cerca de Khand"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPNearKhand/Desc
//"Khand was the name of a land which lay to the south-east of Mordor, located to the south of Rhun and to the east of Alrededores de Harad. \n\n Size: 420 x 380 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 2x Warg Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
"Khand era el nombre de una tierra situada al sureste de Mordor, al sur de Rhun y al este de Alrededores de Harad. \n\n Tamaño: 420 x 380 \n Guaridas: 2x Guarida de Trol, 2x Guarida de Huargo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x Posada"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPRiverCelon
//"River Celon"
"Río Celon"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPRiverCelon/Desc
//"The Celon was a long river in East Beleriand during the First Age of Middle-earth.The Celon began in the Hill of Himring and flowed southwest between the lands of Estolad and Himlad, and passed the borders of Nan Elmoth and Doriath. It was a tributary of the river Aros. \n\n Size: 320 x 325 \n Lairs: 4x Troll Lair, 2x Warg Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
"El Celon era un río largo en el Este de Beleriand durante la Primera Edad de la Tierra Media. El Celon nacía en la Colina de Himring y fluía hacia el suroeste entre las tierras de Estolad y Himlad, pasando por las fronteras de Nan Elmoth y Doriath. Era un afluente del río Aros. \n\n Tamaño: 320 x 325 \n Guaridas: 4x Guarida de Trol, 2x Guarida de Huargo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x Posada"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPRiverHarnen
//"River Harnen"
"Río Harnen"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPRiverHarnen/Desc
//"The River Harnen, known as Southing in Westron, was a river south of Gondor. \n\n Size: 330 x 370 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 2x Warg Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
"El Río Harnen, conocido como Southing en Westron, era un río al sur de Gondor. \n\n Tamaño: 330 x 370 \n Guaridas: 2x Guarida de Trol, 2x Guarida de Huargo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x Posada"
END

//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPTheLonelands
//"The Lone-lands"
"Tierras Solitarias"
END
//not7.0.0
Map:MAPMPTheLonelands/Desc
//"The Lone-lands was a name used by Hobbits for the wilderness east of Bree-land. This area contained, among other features, the Weather Hills and Weathertop. \n\n Size: 315 x 360 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 2x Spider Lair, 2x Goblin Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
"Las Tierras Solitarias era un nombre usado por los Hobbits para referirse a la naturaleza salvaje al este de Bree. Esta zona incluía, entre otros lugares, las Colinas del Tiempo y el Pico del Tiempo. \n\n Tamaño: 315 x 360 \n Guaridas: 2x Guarida de Trol, 2x Guarida de Araña, 2x Guarida de Trasgo \n Estructuras neutrales: 2x Posada"
END

