Map:MAPMPWestfarthing/Desc
//"The Westfarthing was the western and most populated Farthing of the Shire, and was the site of the towns Michel Delving, Tuckborough, and Hobbiton.\n\n Size: 375 x 365 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 4x Warg Lair, 2x Goblin Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
