Map:MAPMPFenmarch
//"Fenmarch"
"Fenmarch"
END
Map:MAPMPFenmarch/Desc
//"The Fenmarch was a marshy border-land along the Mering Stream in the east of Rohan. \n\n Size: 380 x 330 \n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 2x Spider Lair, 2x Goblin Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn, 2x Signal Fire"
"El Fenmarch era una tierra fronteriza pantanosa a lo largo del Arroyo Mering, en el este de Rohan.\n\n Tamaño: 380 x 330\n Cuevas: 2x Cueva de Troles, 2x Cueva de Arañas, 2x Cueva de Trasgos\n Estructuras Neutrales: 2x Taberna, 2x almenaras"
END
